flowchart TD
    X["Preparation or execution failure"] --> L["Saved job state and execution logs"]
    X -->|"When configured"| S["Sentry errors, traces, and logs"]
    L --> A["Supervisor investigates<br/>Current state and prior findings"]
    S --> A
    S -.->|"Unavailable: use stored evidence"| L
    A --> D{"What does the evidence support?"}
    D -->|"Temporary failure"| R["Permitted retry or recovery<br/>Within existing limits"]
    D -->|"Candidate needs revision"| P["Preparation agent revises<br/>and reruns fixed checks"]
    D -->|"Missing user decision"| U["Ask the user"]
    U --> A
    D -->|"Required work cannot succeed"| F["Stop with an explanation"]
    R --> O["Observe and record the outcome"]
    P --> O
    O -->|"Failure remains"| X
    O -->|"Checks pass"| C["Continue the job"]
